      "side": 1,
      "message": "Routing table commits are done generally by the NFC stack when there is a new NFC app installed or uninstalled or if NFC state changes (user changed the default wallet app, etc). \n\nThis hook let\u0027s oem force a routing table update when for ex secure element applet is updated by the OEM (NFC stack does not get this info right now) or if a new SIM is installed which is also acting as a NFCEE.",
